        "note": "Olívia, an ORO WIN woman said yesterday, by Skype, with the help of my friend Edineia Isidoro, that there are 12 speakers of ORO WIN, and that they are trying to revitalize their native language. As for Olívia, the actual name of her group is Oro Towati. She also said that other Txapakura [Chapakuran groups] who spoke other languages very close to her own language have been exterminated, such as the Oro Masam, Oro Japraji', Oro Kitam, Oro An Am."
